    ],
    "text": "An Act to Repeal the Rent Act, No. 7 of 1972",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      130.5,
      309.71,
      156.47
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      167.84,
      309.71,
      231.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Rent (Repeal) Act,No. of 2025 and shall come into operation on the date on which the certificate is endorsed in respect of this Act in terms of Article 79 of the Constitution (in this Act referred to as the \u201crelevant date\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      77.2,
      242.84,
      281.14,
      256.68
    ],
    "text": "2. The Rent Act, No. 7 of 1972 is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      280.34,
      309.71,
      318.97
    ],
    "text": "3. Notwithstanding the repeal of the Rent Act, No. 7 of1972 (in this section referred to as the \u201crepealed Act\u201d) by section 2 of this Act-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.2,
      330.5,
      307.21,
      393.97
    ],
    "text": "(a) no action shall be instituted for the ejectment ofa tenant who is in possession of any premisesgoverned by the provisions of the repealed Act onthe day immediately preceding the relevant date,for a period of one year from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.2,
      405.5,
      307.21,
      481.47
    ],
    "text": "(b) no landlord of any premises governed by theprovisions of the repealed Act on the dayimmediately preceding the relevant date, shalldemand or receive any rent in excess of theauthorised rent payable under the repealed Act, fora period of one year from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.2,
      493.0,
      307.23,
      543.97
    ],
    "text": "(c) any act or thing done or omitted to be done or anyright or entitlement acquired under the repealedAct shall be deemed to be valid for a period of oneyear from the relevant date;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      51.86,
      193.29,
      56.86,
      206.76
    ],
